{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1541073","title":"Integrated domestic wastewater treatment and resource recovery using a microalgal-bacterial consortium in a membrane-assisted photobioreactor system","description":"This project evaluated an innovative membrane-assisted photobioreactor (MAPB) system inoculated with an enriched microalgal-bacterial consortium, achieving efficacious wastewater treatment and biomass generation. The harvested biomass was characterized to evaluate its lipid profile for biodiesel potential, extracellular polymeric substances (EPS) composition, and biostimulant properties. This BioProject provides whole-metagenome sequencing datasets collected at multiple treatment time-points to monitor the community dynamics of the microalgae-dominated consortium during the photobioreactor operation.","center":"Gujarat Biotechnology University","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/10/08 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN64049186","Untreated domestic wastewater","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2025-10-09",2025,"IN","Gujarat",1271715,"Gandhinagar","verified",23.1684,72.6743,"India: Gujarat, Gandinagar",null,"Wastewater treatment plant (ENVO:00002043)","Sewage (ENVO:00002018)","Sewage (ENVO:00002018)","named urban infrastructure at sample level"],["SAMN64049188","Microalgal-bacterial community in photobioreactor (Day 5)","non_environmental",null,"2025-10-15",2025,"IN","Gujarat",1271715,"Gandhinagar","verified",23.1684,72.6743,"India: Gujarat, Gandinagar",null,"Laboratory facility (ENVO:01001406)","Photobioreactor (ENVO:03600077)","Sewage (ENVO:00002018)","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN64049189","Microalgal-bacterial community in photobioreactor (Day 10)","non_environmental",